Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 00:05:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(control-plane): let sessions merge through a
 review-and-CI gate

Founder-approved autonomy change: a session may squash-merge a PR once CI is verified on the head SHA and a separate reviewer identity approved that same SHA. Control-plane, CI and gate-script paths stay founder-merged permanently; migrations, identity-access, billing, usage-ledger, tool-guard and webhook paths stay founder-merged until 2026-11-29. Also narrows the attribution pattern so repository paths are no longer refused, and allows dispatching CI workflows.
